    "detailed_description": "Graduate school life begins with full of expectations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResearch, conference presentations, internships, job hunting, master's thesis, and doctoral advancement. \u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe days are not always pleasant.<br />\r\nSome drop out, some become depressed, some disappear, and some disappear.<br />\r\nThere are many such people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease move forward, believing that a wonderful future will surely await you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 This is how the game works.<br />\r\nPlayers will experience two years in a master's course (Master's course).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBasically, the player chooses what actions to take each day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, it is not easy to graduate. We plan to include events that will interfere with the author in that way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 What are parameters/relationships?<br />\r\nDepending on the values of parameters and relationships, changes in endings, occurrence of specific events, and appearance of specific commands will occur.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 What is a state?<br />\r\nVarious illnesses and abnormal states can occur, such as sleep deprivation, alcoholism, insanity, etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 Credits.<br />\r\nGeneral / Hanachiru (@hanaaaaaachiru)<br />\r\nCharacter illustration by Aluminum Hoshino",
    "about_the_game": "Graduate school life begins with full of expectations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResearch, conference presentations, internships, job hunting, master's thesis, and doctoral advancement. \u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe days are not always pleasant.<br />\r\nSome drop out, some become depressed, some disappear, and some disappear.<br />\r\nThere are many such people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease move forward, believing that a wonderful future will surely await you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 This is how the game works.<br />\r\nPlayers will experience two years in a master's course (Master's course).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBasically, the player chooses what actions to take each day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, it is not easy to graduate. We plan to include events that will interfere with the author in that way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 What are parameters/relationships?<br />\r\nDepending on the values of parameters and relationships, changes in endings, occurrence of specific events, and appearance of specific commands will occur.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 What is a state?<br />\r\nVarious illnesses and abnormal states can occur, such as sleep deprivation, alcoholism, insanity, etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25b7 Credits.<br />\r\nGeneral / Hanachiru (@hanaaaaaachiru)<br />\r\nCharacter illustration by Aluminum Hoshino",
